  o Minor bugfixes (C correctness):
    - Check that a circuit has a channel before circuit_send_first_onion_skin()
      reads that channel's identity digest. Every path that reaches this
      function assigns n_chan first, so the read has never been wrong, but
      forming the address is undefined behavior when n_chan is NULL, and
      node_get_by_id() would go on to copy DIGEST_LEN bytes through that
      address once the nodelist held an entry. Found by
      UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer. Fixes bug XXXXX; bugfix on 0.0.8pre1.
